{"id":"lediglich","lemma":"lediglich","pos":"adv","rank":2726,"glosses":["merely"],"ipa":"/ˈleːdɪklɪç/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/2/2d/De-at-lediglich.ogg/De-at-lediglich.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Ich habe ihn lediglich einmal getroffen.","en":"I only met him once.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"haben"},{"g":"him"},null,{"g":"once, one time"},{"g":"hit, struck, met"}]},{"text":"Ich bin lediglich ehrlich.","en":"I'm just being honest.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"am","l":"sein"},null,{"g":"honest, truthful, true"}]},{"text":"Lediglich ihr könnt diese Frage beantworten.","en":"Only you can answer the question.","words":[null,{"g":"you (pl.) / her"},{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"können"},{"g":"this one, this","l":"dieser"},{"g":"question"},{"g":"to answer"}]},{"text":"Ich habe lediglich versucht zu helfen.","en":"I was only trying to help.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"haben"},null,{"g":"to try, to attempt","l":"versuchen"},{"g":"to / too"},{"g":"to help"}]},{"text":"Ich glaube, es ist lediglich ein Zufall.","en":"I think it is a mere coincidence.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to believe something","l":"glauben"},{"g":"it"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},null,{"g":"a"},{"g":"chance"}]}]}